From c403ccda72ad24701739178ce57cd8647e06af87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 02:03:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - record when a 2nd attacker joins a fight
 (add_after_ms, add_our_hp_pct)

- combat: KillResult add_after_ms (ms into the fight when attackers first reached 2) and
  add_our_hp_pct; fight_log prints " add@N.Ns hpN%"
- deaths.py --adds AREA: every 2+ fight bucketed 0-3 s (the pull brought it), 3-10 s,
  10 s+ (a wanderer joined), with the fatal ones

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
